{"seq":2,"slug":"subagent-and-multi-agent","title":"SubAgent 与多智能体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/agent-patterns/subagent-and-multi-agent","wordCount":1635,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"subagent-与多智能体\">SubAgent 与多智能体</h1><h2 id=\"问题背景\">问题背景</h2><p>单个 Agent 在面对大型、跨领域的复杂任务时，往往会遇到上下文窗口溢出、推理链过长导致质量下降、以及缺乏专业化能力等问题。例如，一个&quot;从零搭建全栈应用&quot;的任务可能涉及前端 UI 构建、后端 API 设计、数据库建模、测试编写等多个专业领域——单个 Agent 很难在一次连续推理中同时胜任所有这些角色。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    PROBLEM[&quot;Challenges of Complex Tasks&quot;]&#10;    PROBLEM --&gt; C1[&quot;Limited Context Window&lt;br/&gt;Cannot fit all info&quot;]&#10;    PROBLEM --&gt; C2[&quot;Long Reasoning Chain&lt;br/&gt;Quality degrades&quot;]&#10;    PROBLEM --&gt; C3[&quot;Capability Limits&lt;br/&gt;One Agent cannot master everything&quot;]&#10;    PROBLEM --&gt; C4[&quot;Sequential Bottleneck&lt;br/&gt;Cannot parallelize&quot;]&#10;&#10;    C1 --&gt; SOLUTION[&quot;Solution: Split into Multiple Agents&quot;]&#10;    C2 --&gt; SOLUTION&#10;    C3 --&gt; SOLUTION&#10;    C4 --&gt; SOLUTION\">flowchart TD\n    PROBLEM[\"Challenges of Complex Tasks\"]\n    PROBLEM --&gt; C1[\"Limited Context Window&lt;br/&gt;Cannot fit all info\"]\n    PROBLEM --&gt; C2[\"Long Reasoning Chain&lt;br/&gt;Quality degrades\"]\n    PROBLEM --&gt; C3[\"Capability Limits&lt;br/&gt;One Agent cannot master everything\"]\n    PROBLEM --&gt; C4[\"Sequential Bottleneck&lt;br/&gt;Cannot parallelize\"]\n\n    C1 --&gt; SOLUTION[\"Solution: Split into Multiple Agents\"]\n    C2 --&gt; SOLUTION\n    C3 --&gt; SOLUTION\n    C4 --&gt; SOLUTION</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>子智能体（SubAgent）是主 Agent 为完成某个子任务而创建的专业化执行者，其生命周期受创建者控制；编排器（Orchestrator）是负责分解任务、调度子 Agent 并汇总结果的主 Agent，本身不直接执行具体子任务；多智能体系统（Multi-Agent System）则是多个 Agent 通过通信协议协作完成一个大型目标的架构形态，成员之间可能是主从关系，也可能是对等的。理解这个模式的关键在于：拆分的收益来自<strong>上下文隔离</strong>与<strong>专业化分工</strong>，成本则来自 Agent 之间的通信、同步与上下文传递——因此任务越复杂、越可并行，多 Agent 的净收益越大；任务简单时，单 Agent 反而更高效。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"模式定义\">模式定义</h2><p>SubAgent（子智能体）是指在一个主 Agent（编排器）的协调下，负责完成特定子任务的专业化 Agent。多智能体系统（Multi-Agent System）则是多个 Agent 通过协作协议共同完成一个大型目标的架构模式。</p>\n<p>核心概念关系如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    USER[&quot;User&quot;] --&gt; ORCH[&quot;Orchestrator Agent&quot;]&#10;&#10;    ORCH --&gt; SA1[&quot;Sub-Agent A&lt;br/&gt;Code Search Expert&quot;]&#10;    ORCH --&gt; SA2[&quot;Sub-Agent B&lt;br/&gt;Code Generation Expert&quot;]&#10;    ORCH --&gt; SA3[&quot;Sub-Agent C&lt;br/&gt;Test Writing Expert&quot;]&#10;&#10;    SA1 --&gt;|&quot;Search Results&quot;| ORCH&#10;    SA2 --&gt;|&quot;Generated code&quot;| ORCH&#10;    SA3 --&gt;|&quot;Test cases&quot;| ORCH&#10;&#10;    ORCH --&gt; RESULT[&quot;Aggregated Result&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    USER[\"User\"] --&gt; ORCH[\"Orchestrator Agent\"]\n\n    ORCH --&gt; SA1[\"Sub-Agent A&lt;br/&gt;Code Search Expert\"]\n    ORCH --&gt; SA2[\"Sub-Agent B&lt;br/&gt;Code Generation Expert\"]\n    ORCH --&gt; SA3[\"Sub-Agent C&lt;br/&gt;Test Writing Expert\"]\n\n    SA1 --&gt;|\"Search Results\"| ORCH\n    SA2 --&gt;|\"Generated code\"| ORCH\n    SA3 --&gt;|\"Test cases\"| ORCH\n\n    ORCH --&gt; RESULT[\"Aggregated Result\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>关键特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SubAgent</td>\n<td>由主 Agent 创建并管理的子任务执行者</td>\n<td>生命周期受主 Agent 控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编排器（Orchestrator）</td>\n<td>负责任务分解、子Agent分配和结果汇总的主 Agent</td>\n<td>不直接执行子任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多智能体系统</td>\n<td>多个 Agent 通过通信协议协作完成复杂目标</td>\n<td>Agent 可能具备对等关系</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"为什么要拆分为子-agent\">为什么要拆分为子 Agent</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动机</th>\n<th>单 Agent 的问题</th>\n<th>多 Agent 的解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>上下文隔离</td>\n<td>所有信息挤在一个窗口中</td>\n<td>每个子 Agent 只关注自己领域的上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专业化分工</td>\n<td>一个系统提示难以覆盖所有领域</td>\n<td>每个子 Agent 有专属的系统提示和工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行加速</td>\n<td>步骤只能顺序执行</td>\n<td>独立的子任务可以并行分发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容错隔离</td>\n<td>一步失败可能导致整体崩溃</td>\n<td>单个子 Agent 失败不影响其他</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可组合性</td>\n<td>能力固定，难以扩展</td>\n<td>可以动态添加新的专业子 Agent</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 拆分子 Agent 并非总是最优选择。任务简单时，引入多 Agent 的开销（通信、同步、上下文传递）反而会降低效率。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"工作流程\">工作流程</h2><h3 id=\"编排器模式-orchestrator-pattern\">编排器模式（Orchestrator Pattern）</h3><p>编排器是多智能体系统中最常见的协调模式。主 Agent 承担&quot;指挥官&quot;角色，负责任务拆解和结果整合：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as User&#10;    participant O as Orchestrator Agent&#10;    participant S1 as Sub-Agent: Search&#10;    participant S2 as Sub-Agent: Coding&#10;    participant S3 as Sub-Agent: Testing&#10;&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;O: &quot;Add caching to UserService&quot;&#10;    O-&gt;&gt;O: Task Decomposition&#10;&#10;    par Parallel dispatch&#10;        O-&gt;&gt;S1: &quot;Search existing UserService implementations&quot;&#10;        O-&gt;&gt;S3: &quot;Find existing test cases&quot;&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    S1--&gt;&gt;O: Return UserService source&#10;    S3--&gt;&gt;O: Return existing tests&#10;&#10;    O-&gt;&gt;S2: &quot;Add cache layer based on this code...&quot;&#10;    S2--&gt;&gt;O: Return modified code&#10;&#10;    O-&gt;&gt;S3: &quot;Write tests for new caching feature&quot;&#10;    S3--&gt;&gt;O: Return new test cases&#10;&#10;    O-&gt;&gt;O: Aggregate and verify all results&#10;    O--&gt;&gt;U: Return complete implementation\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as User\n    participant O as Orchestrator Agent\n    participant S1 as Sub-Agent: Search\n    participant S2 as Sub-Agent: Coding\n    participant S3 as Sub-Agent: Testing\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;O: \"Add caching to UserService\"\n    O-&gt;&gt;O: Task Decomposition\n\n    par Parallel dispatch\n        O-&gt;&gt;S1: \"Search existing UserService implementations\"\n        O-&gt;&gt;S3: \"Find existing test cases\"\n    end\n\n    S1--&gt;&gt;O: Return UserService source\n    S3--&gt;&gt;O: Return existing tests\n\n    O-&gt;&gt;S2: \"Add cache layer based on this code...\"\n    S2--&gt;&gt;O: Return modified code\n\n    O-&gt;&gt;S3: \"Write tests for new caching feature\"\n    S3--&gt;&gt;O: Return new test cases\n\n    O-&gt;&gt;O: Aggregate and verify all results\n    O--&gt;&gt;U: Return complete implementation</pre><h3 id=\"委派模式-delegation-pattern\">委派模式（Delegation Pattern）</h3><p>委派模式中，主 Agent 将整个子任务完整地委托给子 Agent，不干预子 Agent 的内部执行过程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DelegationRequest {&#10;  taskId: string;&#10;  description: string;&#10;  context: string;&#10;  constraints: string[];&#10;  expectedOutput: OutputFormat;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface SubAgentConfig {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  systemPrompt: string;&#10;  tools: ToolDefinition[];&#10;  model: string;&#10;  maxSteps: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function delegateToSubAgent(request: DelegationRequest, config: SubAgentConfig): Promise&lt;SubAgentResult&gt; {&#10;  const subAgent = createAgent(config);&#10;&#10;  const result = await subAgent.execute({&#10;    instruction: request.description,&#10;    context: request.context,&#10;    constraints: request.constraints,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    taskId: request.taskId,&#10;    output: result.output,&#10;    steps: result.executionTrace,&#10;    tokenUsage: result.totalTokens,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DelegationRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  taskId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  constraints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  expectedOutput</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OutputFormat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SubAgentConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  systemPrompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tools</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ToolDefinition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxSteps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> delegateToSubAgent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">request</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DelegationRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SubAgentConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SubAgentResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> subAgent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createAgent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(config);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subAgent.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    instruction: request.description,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    context: request.context,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    constraints: request.constraints,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    taskId: request.taskId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    output: result.output,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    steps: result.executionTrace,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tokenUsage: result.totalTokens,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"扇出-扇入模式-fan-out-fan-in\">扇出/扇入模式（Fan-Out / Fan-In）</h3><p>当多个子任务彼此独立时，可以并行分发（Fan-Out），等所有结果返回后统一汇总（Fan-In）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    TASK[&quot;Main Task&quot;] --&gt; DECOMPOSE[&quot;Task Decomposition&quot;]&#10;&#10;    DECOMPOSE --&gt; T1[&quot;Subtask 1&quot;]&#10;    DECOMPOSE --&gt; T2[&quot;Subtask 2&quot;]&#10;    DECOMPOSE --&gt; T3[&quot;Subtask 3&quot;]&#10;    DECOMPOSE --&gt; T4[&quot;Subtask 4&quot;]&#10;&#10;    T1 --&gt; MERGE[&quot;Result Aggregation&quot;]&#10;    T2 --&gt; MERGE&#10;    T3 --&gt; MERGE&#10;    T4 --&gt; MERGE&#10;&#10;    MERGE --&gt; OUTPUT[&quot;Final Result&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    TASK[\"Main Task\"] --&gt; DECOMPOSE[\"Task Decomposition\"]\n\n    DECOMPOSE --&gt; T1[\"Subtask 1\"]\n    DECOMPOSE --&gt; T2[\"Subtask 2\"]\n    DECOMPOSE --&gt; T3[\"Subtask 3\"]\n    DECOMPOSE --&gt; T4[\"Subtask 4\"]\n\n    T1 --&gt; MERGE[\"Result Aggregation\"]\n    T2 --&gt; MERGE\n    T3 --&gt; MERGE\n    T4 --&gt; MERGE\n\n    MERGE --&gt; OUTPUT[\"Final Result\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function fanOutFanIn(subtasks: DelegationRequest[], configs: SubAgentConfig[]): Promise&lt;AggregatedResult&gt; {&#10;  const promises = subtasks.map((task, index) =&gt; delegateToSubAgent(task, configs[index]));&#10;&#10;  const results = await Promise.allSettled(promises);&#10;&#10;  const succeeded = results&#10;    .filter((r): r is PromiseFulfilledResult&lt;SubAgentResult&gt; =&gt; r.status === &#39;fulfilled&#39;)&#10;    .map((r) =&gt; r.value);&#10;&#10;  const failed = results.filter((r): r is PromiseRejectedResult =&gt; r.status === &#39;rejected&#39;).map((r) =&gt; r.reason);&#10;&#10;  return { succeeded, failed, totalTasks: subtasks.length };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fanOutFanIn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">subtasks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DelegationRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">configs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SubAgentConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">AggregatedResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> promises</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subtasks.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"colo